# Butler Routes - Moonglade druid class guide (pack butler-routes-completionist, v0.37.0).
# The pack's one class guide: the Alliance druid chains centred on Moonglade,
# organised BY CHAIN in level order. Every contracted quest
# (docs/moonglade-census.md, contract moonglade-druid) appears exactly once
# as an accept and once as a turnin. The accept-in-zone rule is relaxed here
# by design: the territory is the druid class chains, so Stormwind, Alterac
# and Tanaris accepts open chains that the Moonglade legs finish.
# Already-contracted chain links stay in their home guides (26, 5921, 5923,
# 6001, 6121, 6123, 6124, 9063, 98393, 3763/3764/3781/3785) - notes point at
# them where a chain needs the pointer, never accept/turnin lines.
# Coordinates use the era frame the data carries, set with zone map lines.
guide butler-routes-completionist/moonglade-druid
title Moonglade - Druid Class Quests
levels 10-52
zone Moonglade
class Druid
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Stormwind Park - Heeding the Call

  zone map 1453

  tip Theridran (36.11, 64.39) in the Park holds the bear-summon for young druids; Sheldras Moontree (35.84, 67.38) keeps the Child of Nature word for later. Take the Call, then carry it to Darnassus.
  accept 5924 only NightElf,Druid -- Heeding the Call - Theridran; Mathrengyl Bearwalker waits in Darnassus
  zone map 1457
  turnin 5924 only NightElf,Druid -- Heeding the Call - the word to Mathrengyl Bearwalker
  note The bear line continues as 5921 (Great Bear Spirit) in the Darnassus guide - run its bear block before the Moonglade rite below.

step Darnassus to Alterac - Child of Nature

  zone map 1416

  tip Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver (14.16, 59.73) in Alterac holds a word for druids; Sheldras Moontree back in Stormwind Park (35.84, 67.38) takes it. No objectives - carry and deliver.
  accept 94912 only Skyborne,Druid -- Child of Nature - Ansirem; Sheldras Moontree waits in Stormwind
  zone map 1453
  turnin 94912 only Skyborne,Druid -- Child of Nature - the word to Sheldras Moontree

step Moonglade - Great Bear Spirit

  zone map 1450

  tip Dendrite Starblaze (56.21, 30.64) speaks the bear rite. The Darnassus bear line 5921 must be turned in first - run the Darnassus guide's bear block before this step.
  accept 5929 only NightElf,Druid -- Great Bear Spirit - Dendrite Starblaze; the rite at his side
  complete 5929 only NightElf,Druid @56.21,30.64 era -- the Great Bear Spirit rite with Dendrite Starblaze
  turnin 5929 only NightElf,Druid -- Great Bear Spirit - the rite to Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 5931 only NightElf,Druid -- Back to Darnassus - Dendrite Starblaze; carry the word to Mathrengyl Bearwalker
  zone map 1457
  turnin 5931 only NightElf,Druid -- Back to Darnassus - the word to Mathrengyl Bearwalker
  note The cure line continues as 6001 in the Darnassus guide - its bear block picks up here.

step Moonglade - the sea trials

  zone map 1450

  tip Dendrite Starblaze (56.21, 30.64) sets the lake trial; Tajarri (36.52, 40.10) keeps the shrine at the Shrine of Remulos (36.00, 41.42) in the north-west. The waters line 26 lives in the Darnassus guide - turn it in before accepting here. Have the Shrine Bauble (15877) ready for the shrine rite.
  accept 29 only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid -- Trial of the Lake - Dendrite Starblaze; the shrine rite in the north-west
  complete 29 only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid @36.00,41.42 era -- the shrine rite at the Shrine of Remulos
  turnin 29 only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid -- Trial of the Lake - the rite to Tajarri
  accept 272 only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid -- Trial of the Sea Lion - Tajarri; the pendant at the shrine
  complete 272 only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid @36.00,41.42 era -- the pendant rite at the Shrine of Remulos
  turnin 272 only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid -- Trial of the Sea Lion - the pendant to Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 5061 only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid -- Aquatic Form - Dendrite Starblaze; Mathrengyl Bearwalker takes the word
  zone map 1457
  turnin 5061 only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid -- Aquatic Form - the word to Mathrengyl Bearwalker

step Moonglade - Power over Poison

  zone map 1450

  tip Dendrite Starblaze (56.21, 30.64) sends the cure south. The Darnassus line 6121 must be turned in first - run the Darnassus guide's cure block before accepting. The Filled Cliffspring Falls Sampler (15845) has no source in the data - have it in your bags (auction house or an alchemist) before you travel.
  accept 6122 only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid -- The Principal Source - Dendrite Starblaze; Alanndarian Nightsong waits in Darkshore
  zone map 1439
  complete 6122 only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid @37.69,40.66 era -- the sampler to Alanndarian Nightsong in the grove
  turnin 6122 only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid -- The Principal Source - the sampler to Alanndarian Nightsong
  note The cure line continues as 6123 in the Darkshore guide - its grove block picks up here.
  zone map 1450
  note The Darkshore line 6124 must be turned in first - run the Darkshore guide's cure block before accepting.
  accept 6125 only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid -- Power over Poison - Dendrite Starblaze; Mathrengyl Bearwalker takes the word
  zone map 1457
  turnin 6125 only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid -- Power over Poison - the word to Mathrengyl Bearwalker

step Moonglade - the Great Cat Spirit

  zone map 1450

  tip Dendrite Starblaze (56.21, 30.64) opens the cat trials; the Great Cat Spirit (54.50, 75.00) waits in the south. The Darnassus line 98393 must be turned in first - run the Darnassus guide's cat block before accepting. The relics (280502, 280679, 280680) have no source in the data - have them in your bags before you travel south.
  accept 98394 only NightElf,Druid -- The Great Cat Spirit - Dendrite Starblaze; the Great Cat Spirit waits south
  turnin 98394 only NightElf,Druid -- The Great Cat Spirit - the word to the Great Cat Spirit
  accept 98396 only NightElf,Druid -- The Great Cat Spirit - the Spirit; three relics for its blessing
  complete 98396 only NightElf,Druid @54.50,75.00 era -- the three relics to the Great Cat Spirit
  turnin 98396 only NightElf,Druid -- The Great Cat Spirit - the relics to the Great Cat Spirit
  accept 98731 only NightElf,Druid -- Blessings of the Great Cat Spirit - the Spirit; Dendrite takes the word
  turnin 98731 only NightElf,Druid -- Blessings of the Great Cat Spirit - the word to Dendrite Starblaze

step Moonglade - the Windborne Cat Spirit

  zone map 1450

  tip The Avatar of Saeyleenan (43.92, 73.44) keeps the windborne trials in the south-west; Dendrite Starblaze (56.21, 30.64) opens them. 98393 (Darnassus-contracted, also pre for the Horde twin 98340) must be turned in first - run the Darnassus guide's cat block before accepting. The relics (280502, 280679, 280680) have no source in the data - have them in your bags before you travel.
  accept 98341 only Skyborne,Druid -- The Great Windborne Cat Spirit - Dendrite Starblaze; the Avatar waits south-west
  turnin 98341 only Skyborne,Druid -- The Great Windborne Cat Spirit - the word to the Avatar of Saeyleenan
  accept 98404 only Skyborne,Druid -- The Great Windborne Cat Spirit - the Avatar; three relics for its blessing
  complete 98404 only Skyborne,Druid @43.92,73.44 era -- the three relics to the Avatar of Saeyleenan
  turnin 98404 only Skyborne,Druid -- The Great Windborne Cat Spirit - the relics to the Avatar of Saeyleenan
  accept 98738 only Skyborne,Druid -- Blessings of the Great Windborne Cat Spirit - the Avatar; Dendrite takes the word
  turnin 98738 only Skyborne,Druid -- Blessings of the Great Windborne Cat Spirit - the word to Dendrite Starblaze

step Moonglade - To Darnassus

  zone map 1450

  tip Both cat blessings end here: Dendrite Starblaze (56.21, 30.64) sends the word to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in Darnassus. Night Elf druids arrive by the Great Cat blessings, Skyborne druids by either chain.
  accept 98397 only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid -- To Darnassus - Dendrite Starblaze; Mathrengyl Bearwalker takes the word
  zone map 1457
  turnin 98397 only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid -- To Darnassus - the word to Mathrengyl Bearwalker

step Tanaris - Bloodpetal Poison

  zone map 1446

  tip Torwa Pathfinder (27.50, 42.70) in Tanaris opens the venom work. The Darnassus line 9063 must be turned in first - Loganaar (52.53, 40.57) in Moonglade offers it in the Darnassus guide, so run that block before accepting here. The work itself happens in Un'Goro.
  accept 9052 -- Bloodpetal Poison - Torwa Pathfinder; Gorishi Stings and Bloodcaps in Un'Goro

step Un'Goro - Bloodpetal Poison (field work)

  zone map 1449

  loop
  goto 43.55,81.23
  goto 43.99,81.99
  goto 44.02,80.75
  goto 45.05,83.71
  goto 45.32,82.61
  goto 45.85,84.57
  goto 46.53,81.83
  kill 6551 optional
  tip The Gorishi hives hum in the north-east wastes; Torwa Pathfinder (71.64, 75.96) takes the venom in the south-west. Eight Gorishi Stings (22435) come off the hive wasps above; the eight Bloodcaps (22434) have no source in the data - have them in your bags before you hunt.
  complete 9052 @45.05,83.71 era -- eight Gorishi Stings off the hive wasps
  turnin 9052 -- Bloodpetal Poison - the venom to Torwa Pathfinder

step Un'Goro - Toxic Test

  zone map 1449

  loop
  goto 31.19,36.42
  goto 34.60,22.37
  goto 57.26,23.68
  kill 6498 optional
  tip The Devilsaurs walk the western wastes and the far north-east; Torwa Pathfinder (71.64, 75.96) takes the test in the south-west.
  accept 9051 -- Toxic Test - Torwa Pathfinder; a Devilsaur in the wastes
  complete 9051 @31.19,36.42 era -- a Devilsaur brought down in the western wastes
  turnin 9051 -- Toxic Test - the test to Torwa Pathfinder

step Un'Goro - A Better Ingredient

  zone map 1449

  tip The Putrid Vine (22444) has no placed source in the data - Atal'alarion carries it but has no spawn, so have the vine in your bags before you close the chain. Torwa Pathfinder (71.64, 75.96) finishes the work.
  accept 9053 -- A Better Ingredient - Torwa Pathfinder; the Putrid Vine for the cure
  complete 9053 @71.64,75.96 era -- the Putrid Vine to Torwa Pathfinder
  turnin 9053 -- A Better Ingredient - the vine to Torwa Pathfinder
